MID_SCXX_07_01_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_001: I'm scared, Sha Lan... *sob*
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_002: It's OK. We have really strong people with us.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_003: Let's keep going and escape together. We'll be fine.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_004: Are you sure we can get through safely? I heard\nthere's all kinds of monsters around here...
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_005: I am aware of the danger. But we cannot sit idly by\nawaiting death.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_006: Fortunately, we've made it this far with no casualties.\nLet's hope we can keep it that way.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_008: A remedy to Answerer's boredom...at last.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_009: What is that? I hear something...strange.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_011: 
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_012: Shaaa!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_013: Aah! It's coming out of the walls and floor!\nWhat... What is it?!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_014: Kyaaah! M-monster! There's blood!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_015: Waaah!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_016: Everyone, stay calm, and stay together!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_018: Those who cannot fight, step back. Do not hinder us.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_019: Disgusting. It's like a snake. But this is no time to\nbe afraid—we have to fight!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_021: 
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_022: Sha Lan, please take charge here. And tend to\nthe injured!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_023: I will. You be careful too!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_024: We were never going to make it... Maybe we should\ngo back to the village.
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_025: Aaah! What's that?!
MID_SCXX_07_01_m01_026: {SetColor=Gray}Is there still something coming? I have to\nprotect everyone!{SetColor=Default}
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_001: So this is the creature's body...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_003: Fascinating. This land holds wonders!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_004: It's so repulsive, I almost don't mind it. Let's just\ntake it out.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_006: 
MID_SCXX_07_02_m16: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_007: The monsters...they're everywhere! We're finished!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_008: We will protect you. {SetColor=Gold}Everyone, move forward.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SCXX_07_02_m01_009: Alright... I'm trusting you!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02_001: It hurts... I don't wanna die...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02_002: *sob* I don't...want to die...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02_003: I'm so sorry... This is my fault. I have failed...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02_004: Don't give up! Aren't there still people you have\nto protect?!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m02_005: Of course... You're right!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03_001: Ngh... What did we do to deserve this...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03_002: Ngh... What did we do to deserve this...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03_003: No! Not another one... Their lives...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03_004: They're coming this way! I'll protect the children!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m03_005: They've made it to Sha Lan already? We have to get\nthem out of there—quickly!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m04: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m04_001: Urk... So...it was our fate to perish...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m04_002: Heh...heh... In the end, we die...
MID_SCXX_07_02_m04_003: Please, stop... If you're taking a life, take\nmine instead!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m04_004: Raaah! What am I for if not to protect them?!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m07: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m07_001: That monster is new to me as well... But if we stick\ntogether, we'll be able to protect everyone!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m07_002: Then we shall. We combine our efforts!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m07_003: This unknown threat seems to set you alight...\nWell, that's reassuring!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m08: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m08_001: That monster is new to me as well... But if we stick\ntogether, we'll be able to protect everyone!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m08_002: Of course. I don't want anyone to die unjustly.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m08_003: You feel as I do. Now, let's end this!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m10: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m10_001: That monster is new to me as well... But if we stick\ntogether, we'll be able to protect everyone!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m10_002: Alright, deal. I risk my life for you here, and you\npromise to deal with Vandahl later.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m10_003: I see... I don't have much money, but I will look\ninto it.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m11: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m11_001: Let's do it, Anatolia! We were made for this!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m11_002: Indeed! It's time to carry out our mission.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m12: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m12_001: Dadao, I need you to focus on helping everyone in\nthis moment—not just me.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m12_002: By helping you, I am helping everyone!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m12_003: Some things never change... Alright, let's do this!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m13: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m13_001: I apologize for dragging you into all of this.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m13_002: You don't have anything to apologize for, Toli! I'm\nhappy to fight by your side.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m13_003: I'm happy too. I won't let you down.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m14: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m14_001: No matter what comes, I'll fight. As Mediator, I will\nprotect everyone!
MID_SCXX_07_02_m15: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m15_001: Everyone capable of moving has escaped, including\nthe children.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m15_002: Understood. Then let's hurry and get out of here.
MID_SCXX_07_02_m17: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_02_m17_001: We've failed at protecting everyone, but we need\nto retreat...
MID_SCXX_07_e02: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e02_001: What a terrifying sound! The villagers are starting\nto {SetColor=Gold}panic{SetColor=Default}!
MID_SCXX_07_e03: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e03_001: If we're going to get these people to safety, we need\nto {SetColor=Gold}calm{SetColor=Default} them down.
MID_SCXX_07_e04: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e04_001: It seems like that monster {SetColor=Gold}can't move far from\nits position{SetColor=Default}.
MID_SCXX_07_e04_002: But its attack range is wide. We have to be careful\nnot to put the villagers in danger.
MID_SCXX_07_e04_003: We might be able to get everyone to safety if we can\ndistract it somehow.
MID_SCXX_07_e06: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e06_001: Defeating that monster seems to have hurt the larger\none as well.
MID_SCXX_07_e07: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e07_001: Look! {SetColor=Gold}That monster is moving differently.{SetColor=Default} 
MID_SCXX_07_e07_002: When we defeated the other monster that moved\nthat way, it stunned the larger one.
MID_SCXX_07_e08: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e08_001: It's getting ready to attack again! There must be\nsomething we can do to stop it.
MID_SCXX_07_e09: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e09_001: Well, we've made it angry. Be ready for an attack!
MID_SCXX_07_e12: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e12_001: There! The exit! Everyone, go now!
MID_SCXX_07_e15: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e15_001: I don't think that thing can follow us...but that\ndoesn't mean I'm not worried about it.
MID_SCXX_07_e18: <TH>
MID_SCXX_07_e18_001: <DLG>Rewards will differ depending on how many Kunlun villagers escape.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_001: We did it—we escaped. I was worried how all that\nwould end.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_033: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_034: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_036: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_002: It's a miracle. I can't believe everyone made it\nout safely.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_003: It's not a miracle. We achieved this by\nworking together.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_004: Not everyone made it... As Mediator,\nI feel inadequate.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_005: We did our best. Besides, we couldn't have stayed\nin the village.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_006: We need to say thank you for the assistance\nwe received.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_007: Yes, you were a great help. Here, a token of\nmy gratitude.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_008: Everyone in the village is deeply grateful. They feel\nthey owe their lives to you.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_009: Thanks to you, we were able to minimize casualties.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_010: Though we suffered losses, we were able to avoid\nworse, thanks to you.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_014: Hmm... This is for Fabio. I wish only for the taste of\nbattle to linger...
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_015: Where will you take these people?
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_016: Hehe. It's nice to see you a little more relaxed.\nThat pretty face of yours always looked so serious.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_017: But what are you planning to do after you leave?
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_019: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_020: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_021: We are heading to a land far to the east. It's a place\nthat can accommodate all of us.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_022: It's a bit sad to leave our homeland—where we were\nborn and raised. But this is the right move.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_023: I think that's it, then. Again, thank you very much.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_025: May we meet again one day.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_026: Come on, don't stand here making small talk.\nYour people are waiting.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_028: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_029: 
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_030: I recognize how much you've helped me. And I want\nto be there to help you too.
MID_SCXX_07_03_m01_031: So if you're ever in need, just call on me. No matter\nhow far I am, I will come immediately.